Millrow v0.1.11 has shipped.

Six fixes in this release, all in the request pipeline:
- caching-and-resume: race condition fixed where resume state was written bef=
ore prior request completed, causing duplicate entries on retry
- online-request-processing: off-by-one in batch index tracking that silently=
 dropped the last request in a batch
- provider-integrations: missing retry backoff for 429 responses on the OpenA=
I-compatible endpoint path
- bulk-llm-inference: file handle leak when a vLLM worker exited mid-stream
- caching-and-resume: cache key collision when two requests shared the same p=
rompt but different generation configs
- online-request-processing: status callback was firing after response finali=
zation, causing a spurious second callback on success

No breaking changes, no migration steps. Full release notes are on the wiki u=
nder engineering (v0.1.11 release notes).

